{# A tool a visitor cannot use yet: named, and a link to login, the one
   action that unlocks it. Hiding it instead teaches nobody that it exists.
   It wears the same orange button as every other tool; .cc-locked only marks
   it. #}
<a class="cc-addclimb-go cc-locked" href="{{ path('login') }}">{{ label }}</a>
